# gcloud's default (auto-generated) .gcloudignore excludes BOTH `.git` and
# `.gitignore` from the uploaded build context. Documenso's docker/Dockerfile
# does `COPY .gitignore .gitignore`, so the build fails ("/.gitignore not found")
# unless `.gitignore` is uploaded.
#
# This file keeps `.gitignore` in the context: we only drop the `.git` directory,
# then reuse `.gitignore`'s patterns (node_modules, build output, etc.) so the
# uploaded tarball stays small.
.git/

#!include:.gitignore
